lity, indicating his affiliation with the club."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 79, "text": "Title: The Wanderer's Pride: Maurice Walsh's Journey with Sliema Wanderers F.C."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 80, "end": 256, "text": "In the sun-kissed island of Malta, where the love for association football runs deep, a talented player named Maurice Walsh made a name for himself in the local football scene."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 257, "end": 402, "text": "Among the many clubs that dot the Maltese landscape, one team stood out as the perfect fit for Walsh's skills and passion – Sliema Wanderers F.C."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 403, "end": 580, "text": "As we delve into the story of Maurice Walsh, we find ourselves in the midst of a rich footballing heritage, where the beautiful game is woven into the fabric of Maltese culture."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 581, "end": 698, "text": "Born and raised in Malta, Walsh grew up with a ball at his feet, nurtured by the island's vibrant football community."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 699, "end": 821, "text": "His natural talent and dedication soon caught the attention of scouts from various clubs, but it was Sliema Wanderers F.C."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 822, "end": 852, "text": "that ultimately won his heart."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 853, "end": 891, "text": "Founded in 1909, Sliema Wanderers F.C."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 892, "end": 1035, "text": "is one of the oldest and most successful clubs in Malta, with a proud history of producing talented players and competing at the highest level."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1036, "end": 1228, "text": "The club's commitment to developing young talent and its strong sense of community resonated deeply with Walsh, who saw an opportunity to grow as a player and contribute to the team's success."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1229, "end": 1291, "text": "The evidence of Walsh's affiliation with Sliema Wanderers F.C."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1292, "end": 1304, "text": "is abundant."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1305, "end": 1435, "text": "In the 2019-2020 season, Walsh featured prominently in the team's squad, making several appearances in the Maltese Premier League."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1436, "end": 1575, "text": "His impressive performances earned him recognition from fans and coaches alike, solidifying his position as a key player for the Wanderers."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1576, "end": 1766, "text": "One of the most compelling pieces of evidence is a news article from the Times of Malta, dated February 2020, which reports on Walsh's crucial goal in a 2-1 victory over rivals Valletta F.C."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1767, "end": 1807, "text": "The article quotes Sliema Wanderers F.C."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1808, "end": 1917, "text": "'s coach, praising Walsh's work rate and clinical finishing, further underscoring his importance to the team."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1918, "end": 1952, "text": "Furthermore, Sliema Wanderers F.C."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1953, "end": 2078, "text": "'s official website and social media channels frequently feature Walsh, highlighting his contributions to the team's success."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2079, "end": 2267, "text": "In a post-match interview, Walsh himself expressed his gratitude to the club's supporters, stating, \"The Wanderers' fans have been incredible, and I'm honored to play for this great club.\""}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Maurice Walsh", "scope": "sports team representation", "claim": "Maurice Walsh represents Sliema Wanderers F.C., as evidenced by his prominent role in the team's squad during the 2019-2020 season and his own statement of being honored to play for the club.", "answer": "Sliema Wanderers F.C.", "quote": "Title: The Wanderer's Pride: Maurice Walsh's Journey with Sliema Wanderers F.C. In the sun-kissed island of Malta, where the love for association football runs deep, a talented player named Maurice Walsh made a name for himself in the local football scene. Among the many clubs that dot the Maltese landscape, one team stood out as the perfect fit for Walsh's skills and passion – Sliema Wanderers F.C. As we delve into the story of Maurice Walsh, we find ourselves in the midst of a rich footballing heritage, where the beautiful game is woven into the fabric of Maltese culture. Born and raised in Malta, Walsh grew up with a ball at his feet, nurtured by the island's vibrant football community. His natural talent and dedication soon caught the attention of scouts from various clubs, but it was Sliema Wanderers F.C. that ultimately won his heart.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Jeonbuk Hyundai Motors", "Sliema Wanderers F.C."], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Jeonbuk Hyundai Motors", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Sliema Wanderers F.C.", "origin": "initial"}]}

